<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-One tender of A$30 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-One tender of A$30 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald's Corp's Australian unit was the only promissory note issuer to hold a tender in the Australian commercial paper market on Friday.</p>
<p>McDonald's A$30 million 30-day issue sold in two lots at 5.97 percent and 5.98 percent each.</p>
<p>Dealers said short-end activity had slowed to a trickle over the morning.</p>
<p>At 11.27 a.m. (0027 GMT), March 90-day bank bill futures were trading at 94.30, four points lower on the day.  </p>
